# A guessing game! Sparky picks a number from 1 to 20.

set secret to random 1 to 20
set tries to 0
set guess to -1

say "I'm thinking of a number from 1 to 20..."

repeat until guess = secret
  ask "Your guess?" into guess
  change tries by 1
  if guess > secret then
    say "Too big! Try smaller."
  else if guess < secret then
    say "Too small! Try bigger."
  end
end

say "YES! You got it in " + tries + " tries!"
beep
